host built-value, build(<value>)

test <case value: builds>
  want hold, built-value/ok

test <case value: pickGet tests elim's tag on TypeScript>
  want hold, built-value/ok
  want hold, tests-elim-tag(built-value, <pickGet>)

test <case value: pickGet reads elim's field on TypeScript>
